==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Leafeon|237}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Leaf Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Sceptile|30}} from the {{TCG|Platinum: Arceus|Arceus}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

